{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/16eab11e82ba4d6dfa6fcf14144418db.avif?t=1759774411\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What if your soul refused to move on?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>One Last Journey</i>, you play as <strong>Selene</strong> and <strong>Aurel</strong>, two souls caught between life and the afterlife. Explore a hauntingly beautiful world of forgotten cities, broken memories, and ghostlight ruins as you uncover the bond that once bound you\u2014and the silence that tore it apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/e64435e5463af63b7b748ba77fb315cd.poster.avif?t=1759774411\" width=550 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/e64435e5463af63b7b748ba77fb315cd.webm?t=1759774411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dual Narrative:</strong>\u00a0Switch between Selene and Aurel, as their paths echo through time \u2014 one in the present, one lost in the past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric World:</strong>\u00a0Explore handcrafted pixel environments from the corrupted sewers to the soul-lit city of Echohold and the darkness below.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Storytelling:</strong>\u00a0Uncover a tale of love, regret, and remembrance told through dialogue, found memories, and environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat &amp; Movement:</strong>\u00a0Use spirit abilities like dashing \u00a0or wielding spectral sword in combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey to the End:</strong>\u00a0There are no branching paths, no choices to undo. This is one last journey \u2014 and it only ends one way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/ee245bfc18ebccf7d0d66282b749f803.poster.avif?t=1759774411\" width=662 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/ee245bfc18ebccf7d0d66282b749f803.webm?t=1759774411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3801030?t=1759774411","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/23913226c6af8f47b5d04c103f59d698937b479b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759774411","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/836984c5b8326ab0aeeb1435d414ffc9c23e7362/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759774411","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/836984c5b8326ab0aeeb1435d414ffc9c23e7362/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759774411","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img